# Why a Windows host's PowerShell, which reports its load and listening ports, gave no answer.

error-windows-host-closed = The host's PowerShell stopped answering.
error-windows-host-size = The host's PowerShell printed more than expected.
error-windows-host-start = Could not start PowerShell for the host.
error-windows-host-timeout = The host's PowerShell took too long to answer.
